WEBVTT

00:05:59.397 --> 00:06:00.416
(Laughter)

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:05.278
She walked elegantly,
like a giraffe on the African savanna,

00:06:05.302 --> 00:06:08.163
holding the flag on her shoulder.

00:06:08.187 --> 00:06:09.572
I jogged behind --

00:06:09.596 --> 00:06:10.610
(Laughter)

00:06:10.634 --> 00:06:15.102
on my tiptoes, holding the flag
on my extended arm,

00:06:15.126 --> 00:06:18.701
so that my head was actually
under the damn flag.

00:06:18.725 --> 00:06:20.595
(Laughter)

00:06:20.619 --> 00:06:23.244
All the cameras were,
of course, on Sophia.

00:06:23.268 --> 00:06:24.965
That was fortunate for me,

00:06:24.989 --> 00:06:28.118
because in most press photos,
I appear too --

00:06:28.142 --> 00:06:30.515
although, often between Sophia's legs --